        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Misiri sifwaananisibwa khu murongooro kumweresi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo eye khunyoa eye kumwesi kwa khataru kwe kumwiiko kukhola ekhumi na mulala, Omwami Wele amboolela ese Esekieli ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wo mundu, boolela Farao omwami owe Misiri, ne babaandu bewe oli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Omwami WELE aloma ali, “Sikila kwachoa kwalea lukali kwola mu maleesi, mala kumwoyo kwakwo kweniinia sikila buleeyi bwakwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ese ndakwakanisia owe kamaani owe chikholo. Ng'ali alakukhola khuloondekhana ne bubwoni bwakwo. Nakumwaatile enje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakeni, be kholo endafu lukali mu kholo, balakurema mala bakulekhe. Khu bikulu ne mumatooma koosi chisakia chakwo chilakwa ne chimbasaana chiakwo chilakwa chifunikhakile mu maloba nimwo kameechi kamaangamo mala babaandu be mu liloba belukhe barure mu siniini siakwo bakwanjukhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinyuni choosi chilamenya mu kusina kwakwo ne chisolo choosi chilamenya mu mbasaana chakwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono khukhwama luno kumurongooro kuuli ameechi kuulachoa kulee, namwe chisakia chilee choole mu maleesi se kulabao tawe. Kimirongooro kilanywa kameechi kilee kibe nga nikwo se kilabao tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami WELE aloma ali, “Endaalo niyo kumurongooro kweekha asi Emakoombe, nalaka kamasika kabeo, nakhiingilila chisiba chichakubaakho mala nakufuunikha; nemekha chinjichi chakwo mala kameechi kamakali kateenya. Nakhola Lebanoni lweunamila sikila nikwo, ne kimirongooro kioosi kie mundaa kianiaala sikila nikwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakhola chikholo chaterema sikila luyoka lwe likwa liakwo khu ndaalo niyo nakumwaatilakho asi Emakoombe alala nende abo babeekha asi Mwiloo; ne kimirongooro kioosi kia Edeni kimirobore lundi kimilayi lukali mu Lebanoni, kioosi kikianyoola kameechi kakolaana, kiaolela mu sibala sie asi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bosi beekha asi Emakoombe alala ne nakwo, babeerwa ne mbalu, alala ne naabo ba baaba lubeka lwakwo, babamenyanga mu siniini siakwo akari we babaandu bakali.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami WELE aloma ali, “Murongooro siina mu mirongooro kia Edeni kukwaba ne luyali ne bunyali nga ewe? Ewe okhekhisibwe asi alala ne kimirongooro kia Edeni mu sibala sie asi. Okhakone alala nende abo bakhamanyile Wele tawe, alala nende abo bareerwa ne bali mwiie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kano niiko kakhanyoole Farao ne babaandu bewe boosi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
